<title>USA: Tate Cty, Miss., $1.75 mln, won by Bank of Mississippi. [CORRECTED 18:25 GMT]</title>
<headline>Tate Cty, Miss., $1.75 mln, won by Bank of Mississippi. [CORRECTED 18:25 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Corrects headline and text to make clear that Bank of Mississippi won the bonds, not Duncan-Williams.)</p>
<p>Bank of Mississippi said it won $1.750 million of Tate County, Miss., general obligation road and bridge bonds, Series 1997.</p>
</text>
